  "solution": "<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/4022749e3647a0f96fe8452cf24e5a9e0dbcc3d75de939fe169a74fa8fe65da6.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure>\n\t\t\t \n\t\t\t<figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/76f690f4dbaeadce97c0025043a5195e17054d8e7ef7c79e1e44bba985ebda62.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\t\n\t\tTrong <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Trong <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là đường trung bình của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>I</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Trong <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>∩</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Áp dụng định lý Menelauyt cho tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tSuy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta cũng có thể chỉ ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>  bằng cách khác: Lấy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, sao cho <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>J</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Khi đó\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tMà  \n\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=